_verse„¥verse	¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙœSo Manasseh made Judah and the inhabitants of Jerusalem to err, and to do worse than the heathen, whom the LORD had destroyed before the children of Israel.¦layout ªlast_verse	…¤book§chapter!«first_verse
